  data: {
    LLM: 'Partners sit opposite. Deal 10 each and 3 to kitty. Bid from six tricks in a suit or No Trumps, or Misere (lose every trick) or Open Misere. Highest bidder takes kitty, discards three, and leads. Follow suit; trick to highest trump or highest of led suit. Joker is highest trump; Right and Left Bower next. First team to 500 wins; minus 500 loses.',
    Player: 'Partners sit opposite. Deal 10 each and 3 to kitty. Bid from six tricks in a suit or No Trumps, or Misere (lose every trick) or Open Misere. Highest bidder takes kitty, discards three, and leads. Follow suit; trick to highest trump or highest of led suit. Joker is highest trump; Right and Left Bower next. First team to 500 wins; minus 500 loses.',
    objective: 'Be the first team to reach 500 points or force opponents to -500 points.',
    gameplay: 'Partners sit opposite. Deal 10 each and 3 to kitty. Bid from six tricks in a suit or No Trumps, or Misere (lose every trick) or Open Misere. Highest bidder takes kitty, discards three, and leads. Follow suit; trick to highest trump or highest of led suit. Joker is highest trump; Right and Left Bower next. First team to 500 wins; minus 500 loses.',
    keyRules: [
      'Bidding order: Spades lowest, Clubs, Diamonds, Hearts, No Trumps. Misere only after someone bid seven. Contractor picks up kitty and discards three. Must follow suit. Trick winner leads next. Opponents score 10 per trick taken when contractors make contract.',
